&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3282&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91daf08b1ed0&quot;&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD tools and pipelines. Ideally with Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and the &lt;mark id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Argo suite.&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
